#: content/templates/main/about.html:7
msgid "About StoneWalker"
msgstr "关于 StoneWalker"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:14
msgid ""
"StoneWalker is a unique platform that combines the joy of geocaching with the"
" beauty of collaborative art. Our mission is to create a global community of "
"stone travelers who paint, hide, and track beautiful stones as they journey "
"around the world."
msgstr ""
"StoneWalker是一个独特的平台,将寻宝游戏的乐趣与协作艺术的美感相结合。我们的使命是创建一个全球社区,让石头旅行者们在世界各地绘制、隐藏和追踪美丽的石头。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:20
msgid "Did you know:"
msgstr "你知道吗："

#: content/templates/main/about.html:20
msgid ""
"One of the oldest known cave paintings, found in Indonesia, is over 45,000 "
"years old. This shows that humans have always been drawn to creating art in "
"unexpected places."
msgstr "在印度尼西亚发现的最古老的已知洞穴绘画之一已有超过45,000年的历史。这表明人类一直被吸引到在意想不到的地方创造艺术。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:24
msgid "Read more about this discovery →"
msgstr "了解更多关于这个发现的信息 →"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:32
msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "它是如何工作的："

#: content/templates/main/about.html:35
msgid "Pick up a brush and paint a stone."
msgstr "拿起画笔，给石头涂上颜色！"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:39
msgid "Click the \"Create a Stone\" button and follow the instructions."
msgstr "点击\"创建石头\"按钮并按照说明操作。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:43
msgid "Glue the custom QR code on the back of the stone."
msgstr "将定制的二维码粘在石头的背面。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:47
msgid "Set it free and watch it travel the world."
msgstr "放手让它去环游世界！"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:54
msgid "Community Guidelines:"
msgstr "社区准则："

#: content/templates/main/about.html:55
msgid "Use non-toxic, weather-resistant paint, like acrylic."
msgstr "使用无毒、耐候的颜料，如丙烯酸颜料。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:56 content/templates/main/about.html:58
msgid "Don\\"
msgstr "不要"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:57
msgid "Be kind and respectful to other community members!"
msgstr "对其他社区成员要友好和尊重！"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:60
msgid ""
"You never know where it might go, or who it might inspire along the way!"
msgstr "你永远不知道它会去哪里，或者在途中会激励谁！"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:65
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "我们的使命"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:66
msgid ""
"StoneWalker is open source and community-driven. We believe that creative "
"expression should be free and accessible to everyone."
msgstr "StoneWalker是开源且由社区驱动的。我们相信创意表达应该是免费的,并且对所有人开放。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:67
msgid ""
"No ads, no data selling, no paywalls on the core experience. Every stone page"
" and every journey map is free to view, forever."
msgstr "没有广告,不出售数据,核心体验没有付费墙。每个石头页面和每张旅程地图都永久免费查看。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:68
msgid ""
"We sustain the project through QR code packs and optional premium features, "
"not through exploiting your attention."
msgstr "我们通过QR码套餐和可选的高级功能来维持项目,而不是通过榨取你的注意力。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:73
msgid "Join the Movement"
msgstr "加入行动"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:74
msgid ""
"Thousands of painted stones are waiting to be created, hidden, and "
"discovered. Whether you are an artist, a hiker, a teacher, or just someone "
"who loves a good adventure, there is a place for you here."
msgstr "成千上万的彩绘石头等待着被创造、隐藏和发现。无论你是艺术家、徒步旅行者、教师,还是只是喜欢冒险的人,这里都有你的位置。"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:81 content/templates/main/about.html:83
msgid "Get Your First QR Code"
msgstr "获取你的第一个QR码"

#: content/templates/main/about.html:85
msgid "Start Your Journey"
msgstr "开始你的冒险！"

